{"5161480": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pencil Topped", "steam_appid": 5161480, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Hello! We at Half-Baked Games are happy to announce Pencil Topped: Chapter 1! We'll need your support to finish this game and make it the best it can be. We've added some goals you can work towards by simply downloading Chapter 1 of the game. Thank you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5161480/extras/98abc6b47ba30f210ccea269ad4f033a.avif?t=1787951553\" width=1544 height=1998 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>You're an eraser in a hand-colored world! </strong></i><br><strong> </strong><br><i> </i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5161480/extras/3c96af35b6dd2a63485a46ba62767418.poster.avif?t=1787951553\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5161480/extras/3c96af35b6dd2a63485a46ba62767418.webm?t=1787951553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5161480/extras/3c96af35b6dd2a63485a46ba62767418.mp4?t=1787951553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In <strong>Pencil Topped</strong>, you play as a little green eraser exploring a colorful world of wonders! Fight epic bosses, platform through unique environments, meet a lovable cast of unique characters, and erase parts of the world to carve your own path!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Momentum-based platforming action! </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5161480/extras/bc3749a60cc1dceac6c1fd608f457181.poster.avif?t=1787951553\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5161480/extras/bc3749a60cc1dceac6c1fd608f457181.webm?t=1787951553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5161480/extras/bc3749a60cc1dceac6c1fd608f457181.mp4?t=1787951553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Utilize your skills as a Pencil Topper to navigate your way through 5 different worlds, each with their own theming and unique gameplay mechanics! Erase sketches to clear a path forward, jump over obstacles and dash through dangerous traps. Your movement is based on momentum. Dash at the right time in mid-air to receive a huge boost to your speed, erase partway through a jump to stall for your dash to get recharged, and find different ways to power through each level!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Fight epic bosses!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5161480/extras/c832bd963ae3d7875dc1f963498427cf.poster.avif?t=1787951553\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5161480/extras/c832bd963ae3d7875dc1f963498427cf.webm?t=1787951553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5161480/extras/c832bd963ae3d7875dc1f963498427cf.mp4?t=1787951553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Test your skills by facing off against tons of unique bosses, each with their own attacks and gimmicks that are sure to keep you on your toes! Will you play it safe and wait for openings, or be aggressive and attack at every possible opportunity?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Meet your new friends!</strong><br><br><strong></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5161480/extras/d956bbc7037ad01b3ff2586b7dae34dc.poster.avif?t=1787951553\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5161480/extras/d956bbc7037ad01b3ff2586b7dae34dc.webm?t=1787951553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5161480/extras/d956bbc7037ad01b3ff2586b7dae34dc.mp4?t=1787951553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Say hello to a fun cast of characters! Each have their own side quests and unique personalities. Maybe if you can befriend everyone, something special will unlock...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The things you say... the people you meet... the people you help, the people you don't help... Everything culminates into one of 3 main possible endings. Can you find them all? Or a better question... Should one be pursued in the first place?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Secrets...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">There's lots hidden in this strange, dream-like world. Some bosses and levels may not be in plain sight. Explore each area from top-to-bottom to discover the secrets hidden just out of view.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Explore a colorful world of wonders in Pencil Topped. Erase your obstacles, clear a path forward, and face danger head-on. Inspired by Cuphead, Hollow Knight, and Yoshi's Island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br>  </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i><strong>You're an eraser in a hand-colored world! </strong></i><br><strong> </strong><br><i> </i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5161480/extras/3c96af35b6dd2a63485a46ba62767418.poster.avif?t=1787951553\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5161480/extras/3c96af35b6dd2a63485a46ba62767418.webm?t=1787951553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5161480/extras/3c96af35b6dd2a63485a46ba62767418.mp4?t=1787951553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In <strong>Pe